 this.resolver.getEventsPath() on each invocation. JobLocationResolver computes the path from construction-time fields (changeDir, stateRoot, slug) that never change during the instance lifetime, making repeated calls equivalent to a single cached call.","line":192},{"severity":"low","file":"src/config/store.ts","title":"loadConfig delegation preserves configMissingError and if(repoRoot) guard","rationale":"loadConfigWithSourceMetadata has the same if(repoRoot) guard around the project-local file read, and throws the same configMissingError() when both files are absent. The returned .config field is built by the same read→migrate→merge→validate chain as the original loadConfig body.","line":77}]},"followUpAttempts":0,"transientRetryAttempts":0,"addedTurns":{"reportRetry":0,"postWork":0,"outputRepair":0}},"startedAt":"2026-08-07T13:12:50.577Z","endedAt":"2026-08-07T13:21:41.014Z"}
